    <item>
      <title>SC Menu 2.1</title>        
  <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[
- Added configuration option to configure days to show notification until certificates expire (MDM or defaults write command)
- Fixed issue with displaying com.apple.ctkcard:user 
- Updated to show new icon in Preferences window
- Sped up UI changes and notifications on card insertion by moving certain functions to MainActor and async/await
- Added Sparkle Framework for app updating 
  ]]></description>
